  <item>
    <title>Vol 07. 养宠实用指南：那些神奇好养的小众宠物</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e897de2d96b6aa80365ef9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e897de2d96b6aa80365ef9</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 08 Mar 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本次我们邀请到小啵和她的男朋友小胖，小胖养过很多奇葩、冷门的动物，算是一个隐蔽的民间动物高手（还会给动物开猛药的那种）。本期节目我们聊了一些大家平常基本不会养的神奇动物，例如红眼鹰蜥、蓝舌石龙子...</span></p><span></span><p><span>刚开始我们完全不能理解，为什么小胖为什么别具一格不爱养猫狗，聊到最后我们居然理解了，甚至有点佩服。</span></p><span></span><p><span>btw, 和情侣录播客真是太有趣了！因为他们完全不秀恩爱，只会互骂, 大家可以放心听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>周顺发（微博： </span><a href="https://weibo.com/p/1005056335845759/home" data-url="https://weibo.com/p/1005056335845759/home"><span>周顺发Zz</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>反老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小啵、小胖</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> 正片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 小胖养过哪些奇葩的动物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a> 爬宠里的大美女，自带妆容。动画片的无牙仔的原型原来就是它！为何被称作暴毙王？最短的只活了23分钟。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a> 家里给热带雨林类动物的生态环境是怎么做的？好像在家里做了一个大自然。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 这些动物会吃什么特别的食物？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="759">12:39</a> 小胖推荐大家可以玩的爬虫：蓝舌石龙子。推荐理由：可以活40年、不咬人、温顺、没有体味、不用遛。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="989">16:29</a> 小啵帮小胖养小乌龟来福的故事，你叫它一下，十几分钟才能到位，你要等，要有耐心。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 买卖野生动物的人，现在在踩缝纫机的故事！这块儿极具教育意义。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1309">21:49</a> 生病了怎么办？可以看看民间开猛药的小医生。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1503">25:03</a> 为什么有人会喜欢养这些特别神奇的小动物？听完以后感觉理解了另外一个世界，像出家一样。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【动物介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>为了便于听众理解这些神奇的动物，以下为本期节目提及的动物名字及图片：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 豹纹守宫、瘤尾守宫、蓝舌石龙子</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn-lHRGnfDAHfERwWzV3R8huu30O.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnMRifN2tFmDmIT2bZxWMaVZbLoy.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Funvi4bIz6GjPPrVaDPTPBKmQ0oQ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">02:23</a> 红眼鹰蜥</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpx9x4Ho9qnr54ETcvmUNhpH8_lc.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">03:58</a> 牛奶树蛙</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fil2UQt9sRpMHEI5rQ7piLoTdhaZ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 变色龙be</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlpUBBTTVxUFUfKvFM1zHAaMe2bX.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="726">12:06</a> 睫角守宫</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhEGZwEgXy4AG7TCoSdS-6ULW5q2.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1106">18:26</a> &nbsp;绿鬣蜥</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo4Maq8rdEbLjnAAE_wkcVOZaewm.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【喜欢的宠电宝友看这里！】</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位宠电宝友友和我们交流！我们欢迎一切动物相关小发现、小故事的交流！</span></p><span></span><p><span>扫码添加宠电宝小助手(微信号：petpower), 也可以拉你进听友群哦。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi2clWgPkHHIbwdPNk8RgJrIc0t2.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>合作联系：zeozhou@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Immortals</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lv3pl4LV5w8ioyYMEb8rum7Dxemn.m4a" length="30686742" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:31:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z1WTc1Z1VtYTlSdWRkbkhRSjFNdElZRHZnTmMucG5n.png"/>
