  <item>
    <title>Vol 05. 小区养宠物抓马二三事：爱豆请向网红猫学习</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6585851dcab6086ec12f4eac</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6585851dcab6086ec12f4eac</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Dec 2023 12:46:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目从我们最近在小区楼下遇到的小博美惨死案件聊起，原来在这么小的一个小区里面，养宠物也能发生各种可怕、抓马、无语的事情。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们发现宠物之死其他业主可能并不关心，但如果可能伤及他们的孩子，他们也会和宠物主人站在一起，小博美案件让业主出现了史无前例的团结。</span></p><span></span><p><span>景点的网红猫都是绝育的，最称职的爱豆大概是这样吧...</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>周顺发（微博： </span><a href="https://weibo.com/p/1005056335845759/home" data-url="https://weibo.com/p/1005056335845759/home"><span>周顺发Zz</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>反老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">0:56</a> 小博美惨死疑云开端</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">4:00</a> 小博美事件业主群后续发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 小博美案件让业主出现了史无前例的团结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="717">11:57</a> 初闯小区的宠物主人E人群</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 小区宠物主人撕b事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1144">19:04</a> 小区流浪猫被小区保安过度喂养剩饭剩菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1445">24:05</a> 小区流浪猫泛滥应该绝育，网红景点的网红猫都是绝育的，请爱豆向网红猫学习。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【喜欢的宠电宝友看这里！】</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位宠电宝友友和我们交流！我们欢迎一切动物相关小发现、小故事的交流！</span></p><span></span><p><span>扫码添加宠电宝小助手(微信号：petpower), 也可以拉你进听友群哦。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi2clWgPkHHIbwdPNk8RgJrIc0t2.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>合作联系：zeozhou@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>白鸽</span></p>]]></description>
