  <item>
    <title>Vol 04. 穷养大法好，谁说没钱就不能养宠物啊？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657b2685991e2ee608d4b2ab</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">657b2685991e2ee608d4b2ab</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 14 Dec 2023 16:00:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>没钱就不可以养宠物吗？我们不相信！</span></p><span></span><p><span>网上充斥着各种富养狗的声音，有时候看多了真的会让我们感到焦虑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以这期节目我们分享了一些穷养宠物的方法和故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>周顺发（微博： </span><a href="https://weibo.com/p/1005056335845759/home" data-url="https://weibo.com/p/1005056335845759/home"><span>周顺发Zz</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>反老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>千千</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a>正片开始：千千的小狗的特殊来历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a>养宠物最花钱的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a>养宠物最便宜的一个月花了多少钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="884">14:44</a>我们分享了一下自己独特的省钱大法，有的方法我都不好意思告诉别人...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1258">20:58</a>网购宠物用品的省钱大法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a>你觉得有必要给宠物买零食吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1835">30:35</a>有必要给宠物买玩具吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【喜欢的宠电宝友看这里！】</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位宠电宝友友和我们交流！我们欢迎一切动物相关小发现、小故事的交流！</span></p><span></span><p><span>扫码添加宠电宝小助手(微信号：petpower), 也可以拉你进听友群哦。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi2clWgPkHHIbwdPNk8RgJrIc0t2.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>合作联系：zeozhou@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>八块钱买绿豆冰</span></p>]]></description>
