  <item>
    <title>Vol 01.【宠物吐槽小会】小狗发疯，主人气懵</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/655f86db0500be931cfb34ab</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">655f86db0500be931cfb34ab</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 Nov 2023 17:07:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>虽然我们很爱我们的小动物，但是有的时刻我们真的真的很崩溃。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不管了</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们就是要吐槽一下我们的宠物！</span></p><span></span><p><span>- Why？我家小狗是infp？竟多次上演宠物版发疯文学，试问作为南京市文明养犬人该如何应对？</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 诶，我家小猫钟爱吃芝士奶油，对其他食物欲望极低，它该不会是马斯洛需求体系的上等小猫吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 哎，小狗的尿尿需求真是令人难以捉摸。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 崩溃！我家小猫爱拉稀，我们叫它猫慕希吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 我真的很需要化毛膏！为什么只有小动物有化毛膏啊，人类吃进去的毛又有谁来拯救。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>周顺发（微博：@ </span><a href="https://weibo.com/p/1005056335845759/home" data-url="https://weibo.com/p/1005056335845759/home"><span>周顺发Zz</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>反老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 我家小狗过于敏感，多次上演宠物版发疯文学。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">05:29</a> 我家的马斯洛上等小猫。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">11:11</a> 崩溃！我家小猫爱拉稀，我们叫它猫慕希吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="905">15:05</a> 小狗的尿尿思路令人难以捉摸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1224">20:24</a> 我从来没想过猫猫掉毛真的影响我的时刻是化妆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1618">26:58</a> 你后悔过养现在这个宠物吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【喜欢的宠电宝友看这里！】</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位宠电宝友友和我们交流！我们欢迎一切动物相关小发现、小故事的交流！</span></p><span></span><p><span>扫码添加宠电宝小助手(微信号：petpower), 也可以拉你进听友群哦。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi2clWgPkHHIbwdPNk8RgJrIc0t2.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>合作联系：zeozhou@163.com</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>With U</span></p><span></span><p><span>反老师的小猫：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhdx2bkb-F1WVEdOL8DZixRLRw35.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoP38RVfi7Hoqqfor7h56YKAfUT_.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>顺发的小狗：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnGQleK4fiQn500mgoC054vJRuQ4.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh8iam5eiCJ3UINTvXwyN3bkCDAd.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
